mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825850/extras_big/ae3b119f27a0da3e0ae2b9926e69ddc0.avif?t=1765648632 width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Resist screeching to the sound of the hunter's detector by spamming buttons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825850/extras/706d2746fa97bccd38e198625a17c68c.poster.avif?t=1765648632\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825850/extras/706d2746fa97bccd38e198625a17c68c.webm?t=1765648632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825850/extras/706d2746fa97bccd38e198625a17c68c.mp4?t=1765648632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825850/extras/4b9204ef7e2f69d3b6a79edfcc683daa.avif?t=1765648632\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825850/extras_big/4b9204ef7e2f69d3b6a79edfcc683daa.avif?t=1765648632 width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>You can now begin your covert invasion and drag the hunter back to your ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825850/extras/79ba34849fcfb46cb3a7e6dd6e9a6b74.poster.avif?t=1765648632\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825850/extras/79ba34849fcfb46cb3a7e6dd6e9a6b74.webm?t=1765648632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou